WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:01.560
Don't worry

00:01.640 --> 00:04.840
I'll go out personally to explain to them

00:06.500 --> 00:13.500
You left the city through the south gate and headed toward the volunteer forces, never expecting the news of Xuan's Prince of Jin appearing outside the city...

00:14.000 --> 00:22.500
The Wunu army mobilized immediately: the main force swung south to envelop the volunteer army, while others assaulted the city with full might. Unable to flee back inside the walls in time, you were left with no choice but to fight to the death.

00:23.000 --> 00:30.500
In the eleventh month of the nineteenth year of Yuankang, the Wunu main force raided the volunteer army, easily claiming the head of Xuan's Prince of Jin. Thereafter, in merely four hours, they completely broke Yiyang.
